🌟 Task-1 | Personal Portfolio Website (Level-1)

📝 Overview
I’ve completed Task-1: Personal Portfolio Website as part of my Level-1 Web Development Internship at CodSoft 💻✨
This project demonstrates my understanding of HTML and CSS by creating a clean, structured, and beginner-friendly personal portfolio website.

🚀 Features
🏷 Header Section: Name and tagline
👤 About Section: Profile image and short bio
💻 Skills Section: Lists technical skills
📂 Projects Section: Showcases personal projects with images and descriptions
📄 Resume Section: Downloadable resume in PDF format
📞 Contact Section: Displays email and phone number

🛠 Technologies Used
HTML 📄
CSS 🎨

